OL,3,ABritish man charged in Singapore two
OL,4,Ayears after alleged theft at airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FSingapore has charged a British man for
OL,7,Ftheft more than two years after he
OL,8,Fallegedly stole a denim jacket from a
OL,9,Fstore at the airport shopping mall.
OL,11,FThe police were alerted to the theft in
OL,12,Fthe evening of 14 August 2024 when a
OL,13,Fretail assistant at Singapore's Changi
OL,14,FAirport realised a blue denim jacket
OL,15,Fwas missing from a display mannequin.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
