OL,3,ABritish man charged in Singapore two
OL,4,Ayears after alleged theft at airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FSurveillance footage showed a man
OL,7,Fremoving the jacket, worth about S$350
OL,8,F($275; #202), from the mannequin and
OL,9,Fleaving the store without making
OL,10,Fpayment. By the time the authorities
OL,11,Festablished his identity, the man had
OL,12,Fdeparted Singapore.
OL,14,FThe 26-year-old was arrested on 15
OL,15,FAugust this year while in transit at
OL,16,Fthe airport and was charged on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
